1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
Face the fear that comes with being consistent.
面对坚持行动所带来的恐惧。

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:07,630
When our dreams require us to show up in new ways it scares us.
当梦想要求我们以新的方式出现和行动时，我们会害怕。

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:15,559
Not because our dreams are scary but mostly for me because I wanted to do everything right.
不是因为梦想本身可怕，至少对我来说，更多是因为我想把一切都做对。

4
00:00:15,559 --> 00:00:26,239
The uncertainty of this future that I wanted that I could potentially be present in but not be good at was a bru to my ego.
我想要的未来充满不确定：我也许能进入其中，却可能做不好，这刺到了我的自尊。

5
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:31,030
And in order to keep myself safe I would just freeze.
为了保护自己，我就会僵住，什么都不做。

6
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:34,800
To be honest a lot of us sabotage things like a child.
说实话，我们很多人会像小孩一样把事情搞砸。

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:39,280
We have these things that we want and that are in our hands and in our power.
我们想要的那些事情，本来就在自己手中，也在自己能力范围内。

8
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:47,520
And because it's new and because we haven't really invested the time enough to understand its function or its systems.
但因为事情是新的，我们也没花足够时间去理解它的功能或运作方式。

9
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:51,720
Or ways that it can be useful for us or ways that we can master it.
也没弄清它怎样能帮到我们，或怎样才能掌握它。

10
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:57,280
The first sign of a mistake or a misunderstanding ending we throw it to the ground in frustration.
一出现错误或不理解，我们就沮丧地把它扔到地上。

11
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:02,000
And we drop things and we never pick them up again.
我们丢下那些事，再也不重新拾起来。

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,440
When you have a mission to do something some of the missions in pursuit to the things that you want will not be 100 successful.
当你有使命要完成时，追求目标过程中的一些行动不会百分之百成功。

13
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:17,640
But it doesn't mean you are not worthy of having those things which is why strategy is very important.
但这并不说明你不配拥有那些东西，所以策略非常重要。

14
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:27,239
What changed the way I showed up from maybe posting once every couple of months expecting the same outcome that posting once a week brought me.
我以前可能几个月才发一次内容，却期待获得每周发一次时那样的结果；后来我改变了行动方式。

15
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:36,000
I had to change my emotional entitlement to the work that I was too afraid to face.
我必须改变对回报的情绪性期待，面对自己一直害怕做的工作。

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,480
Yes it takes more energy to do what I'm doing now than what I did before.
没错，我现在做的事比以前花更多精力。

17
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:51,959
But that is the sacrifice that I decided I wanted when I claimed that this thing was something that I also wanted to.
但既然我说自己想要这件事，这就是我决定接受的付出。

18
00:01:51,959 --> 00:02:04,000
I had to realize and I had to come in agreeance with myself that I was worthy of that sacrifice enough to have an expectation of something great within myself.
我必须认识到并说服自己：我值得作出这份付出，也值得对自己抱有出色表现的期待。

19
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:18,800
To act on that greatness 99 8 of the time even though my emotions were not 99 8 all in.
我要几乎一直按这种潜能行动，即便情绪并不总是完全投入；原字幕数字说法待复核。

20
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:34,440
I think when you actually deem yourself worthy enough to have an expectation of something great within yourself that's when consistency becomes less of an issue.
我认为，真正觉得自己值得对自己抱有高期待时，坚持就不再那么成问题。

21
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:39,640
And I also think about it like this our schools required a certain level of greatness from us.
我也会这样想：学校曾要求我们达到一定的优秀程度。

22
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:44,319
Our caregivers were held to a standard in order to keep us in that household.
养育我们的人，也必须达到一定标准，才能维持我们所在的家庭。

23
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:50,520
The jobs that we have require a level of skill and competence from us.
我们的工作也要求我们具备一定的技能和能力。

24
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:56,790
You also deserve a piece of that too because you want to change your outcome.
你也值得把一部分这种努力留给自己，因为你想改变自己的结果。

25
00:02:56,800 --> 00:03:02,999
Repeat after me I preserve 100 of my excellence for me and my endeavors.
跟我重复：我把自己百分之百的优秀留给我自己，以及我努力追求的事情。

26
00:03:02,999 --> 00:03:08,120
I am worthy of my own 100 and tap your chest and let it be done.
我值得得到自己百分之百的投入；拍拍自己的胸口，就让这件事确定下来。
